{"id":"wb-7-770","name":"巷口寿圣寺砖塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"寿圣寺塔 (芮城)","text":"芮城寿圣寺俗称“塔寺”，位于山西省运城市芮城县城关镇县城东北部巷口村西侧舍利东街与亚宝北路路口东北角，原在旧城墙外东北数百步的巷口村，现已融入城区范围内。巷口寿圣寺砖塔已列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AF%BF%E5%9C%A3%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94_(%E8%8A%AE%E5%9F%8E)","revisionId":95248436,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95248436","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4003e2c7312a932e60b20dbc.jpg","title":"20260504_Pagoda_of_Shousheng_Temple_in_Xiangkou_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260504_Pagoda_of_Shousheng_Temple_in_Xiangkou_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c3/20260504_Pagoda_of_Shousheng_Temple_in_Xiangkou_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​山西芮城 巷口寿圣寺砖塔","width":320,"height":480}}